Independent Watchlist CRUD API

Movie fields: id, title, releaseYear. Server assigns the ID. Store movies in memory.


GET /movies
GET /movies/{id}
POST /movies
PUT /movies/{id}
DELETE /movies/{id}

Create/update JSON:
{"title":"Interstellar","releaseYear":2014}

Rules: required nonblank title; releaseYear required, 1888–2100 inclusive. PUT replaces existing details and retains the ID. Invalid writes must leave existing data unchanged. Duplicate titles are allowed.

Use 201 plus Location for creation; 204 without a body for successful deletion; 404 for missing IDs; 400 for invalid input. Do not allocate IDs with collection size + 1.

